<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow"><span class="tiny-square"></span> DOCUMENTS TO DECISIONS</div><h1>{{TITLE}}</h1><p class="page-subtitle" id="subtitle"></p></div><div class="profile-chip"><i class="bi bi-person-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i><span id="activeProfile">Default profile</span></div></div>
<div class="workflow-strip" aria-label="Workflow"><span><b>01</b> Add documents</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>02</b> Extract & review</span><i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i><span><b>03</b> <span id="lastStep">Validate & export</span></span></div>
<div class="stats-grid" id="stats"></div>
<div id="feedback" class="alert d-none" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<section class="panel upload-panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2 id="uploadHeading">Add your documents</h2><p id="uploadDescription">Start with a document or explore the included sample workspace.</p></div><button class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" id="sampleButton"><i class="bi bi-play-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Try sample data</button></div>
<div class="upload-grid" id="uploadGrid"><label class="drop-zone" id="primaryDrop"><input class="file-input" id="primaryFiles" type="file" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" multiple aria-label="Choose documents"><span class="upload-icon"><i class="bi bi-cloud-arrow-up" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><strong id="primaryLabel">Drop invoices here</strong><span>or click to browse</span><small>PDF, JPG or PNG · up to 10 MB per file</small></label><label class="drop-zone secondary-zone d-none" id="secondaryDrop"><input class="file-input" id="secondaryFile" type="file" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg" aria-label="Choose supporting document"><span class="upload-icon"><i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text" aria-hidden="true"></i></span><strong id="secondaryLabel">Drop supporting document</strong><span>or click to browse</span><small id="secondaryHint">PDF, JPG or PNG · up to 10 MB</small></label></div>
<div id="queue" class="queue" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="upload-footer"><span class="small text-secondary" id="extractionHint">Extraction uses your active profile.</span><button class="btn btn-primary" id="extractButton" disabled><i class="bi bi-stars" aria-hidden="true"></i> Extract documents</button></div>
<div id="progressArea" class="d-none mt-3"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between small mb-2"><span id="progressLabel" aria-live="polite">Extracting…</span><span id="progressCount"></span></div><progress id="progressBar" max="100" value="0" aria-label="Document extraction progress"></progress><p class="small text-secondary mt-2 mb-0">Large documents may take several minutes. The SDK processes pages in chunks. Keep this tab open.</p></div>
</section>
<section class="panel d-none" id="criteriaPanel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Job criteria</h2><p>Review the job description and confirm the criteria used to rank every candidate.</p></div><span class="tag">HUMAN REVIEW</span></div><label class="form-label" for="jdText">Job description</label><textarea id="jdText" class="form-control mb-3" rows="3" placeholder="Paste the job description, or upload it above. For .txt files, use ‘Required skills: …’ and ‘Minimum experience: … years’." maxlength="50000"></textarea><div class="criteria-grid"><div><label class="form-label" for="requiredSkills">Required skills · comma separated</label><input class="form-control" id="requiredSkills" placeholder="e.g. Python, SQL, REST APIs"></div><div><label class="form-label" for="minYears">Minimum experience (years)</label><input class="form-control" id="minYears" type="number" min="0" max="80" step="0.5" value="0"></div><div><label class="form-label" for="skillWeight">Skill weight (%)</label><input class="form-control" id="skillWeight" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="80"></div></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 align-items-center mt-3"><button class="btn btn-dark" id="rankButton">Compare & rank <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><span class="small text-secondary">Exact skill matching + experience coverage. Remaining weight goes to experience.</span></div><p class="small text-secondary mt-3 mb-0">Scores support human review. They use only the skills and experience shown below; candidates with missing required evidence remain unranked.</p></section>
<section class="panel d-none" id="matchPanel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2>Reconcile the pair</h2><p>Compare unique item codes, or exact descriptions when an item code is unavailable.</p></div><button class="btn btn-dark" id="matchButton" disabled>Compare documents <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div><div id="pairStatus" class="pair-status"></div></section>
<section class="panel results-panel"><div class="section-head"><div><h2 id="resultsHeading">Document register</h2><p id="resultsSubtitle">Extracted fields, transparent checks, and exceptions in one place.</p></div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><button class="btn btn-light btn-sm" id="exportCsv" disabled><i class="bi bi-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> CSV</button><button class="btn btn-light btn-sm" id="exportJson" disabled>JSON</button><button class="btn btn-light btn-sm" id="clearButton" disabled>Clear</button></div></div><div id="sampleNotice" class="sample-notice d-none"><i class="bi bi-info-circle" aria-hidden="true"></i> Sample workspace · synthetic records, no API calls. Clear it before extracting your documents.</div><div id="results"></div></section>
<footer class="workspace-footer"><span>DocXtract Examples · {{STACK}}</span><span>Yellow. Black. Less paperwork.</span></footer></main></div>
<div class="modal fade" id="settingsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="settingsTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-scrollable"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR CONNECTION</div><h2 class="modal-title fs-4" id="settingsTitle">Profiles & settings</h2></div><button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close settings"></button></div><form id="settingsForm"><div class="modal-body"><div class="settings-grid"><div><label class="form-label" for="profileSelect">Saved profiles</label><select class="form-select" id="profileSelect"></select></div><div class="d-flex gap-2 align-items-end"><button type="button" id="newProfile" class="btn btn-outline-dark">New profile</button><button type="button" id="deleteProfile" class="btn btn-light">Delete</button></div><div><label class="form-label" for="profileName">Profile name</label><input id="profileName" class="form-control" required maxlength="80"></div><div><label class="form-label" for="apiKey">DocXtract API key</label><input id="apiKey" type="password" class="form-control" placeholder="sk_…" autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false"><small class="text-secondary">Stored for this browser session only.</small></div><div><label class="form-label" for="model">Model override</label><input id="model" class="form-control" list="modelsList" placeholder="API default"><small class="text-secondary">Leave blank to use the document type.</small></div><div><label class="form-label" for="documentType">Document type</label><input id="documentType" class="form-control" list="modelsList" required></div><div class="extra-setting d-none"><label class="form-label" for="otherModel" id="otherModelLabel">Supporting document model</label><input id="otherModel" class="form-control" list="modelsList"></div><div class="extra-setting d-none"><label class="form-label" for="otherDocumentType" id="otherTypeLabel">Supporting document type</label><input id="otherDocumentType" class="form-control" list="modelsList"></div><div class="money-setting"><label class="form-label" for="tolerance">Amount tolerance (currency units)</label><input id="tolerance" class="form-control" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.01" required></div><div id="quantitySetting" class="d-none"><label class="form-label" for="quantityTolerance">Quantity tolerance</label><input id="quantityTolerance" class="form-control" type="number" min="0" max="100" step="0.001"></div></div><datalist id="modelsList"></datalist><p class="small text-secondary mt-3">DocXtract treats model and document type as aliases. A model override takes precedence. Connect to discover the models enabled for your key.</p><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3"><button type="button" class="btn btn-dark btn-sm" id="connectButton"><i class="bi bi-plug" aria-hidden="true"></i> Test connection & load models</button><span class="small" id="connectionStatus" role="status"></span></div><div class="form-check mt-4"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="rememberResults"><label class="form-check-label" for="rememberResults">Keep extracted results in this browser after reload</label><small class="d-block text-secondary">Optional local storage. Exports and saved results can contain document data.</small></div><details class="mt-4"><summary>Field mapping · for custom extraction schemas</summary><p class="small text-secondary mt-2">Map normalized field names to paths inside extraction data. Use dot paths and | for alternatives. Leave {} for the standard mappings. See README for supported keys.</p><label class="form-label" for="mapping">Main document mapping (JSON)</label><textarea id="mapping" class="form-control font-monospace" rows="4" spellcheck="false">{}</textarea><div id="poMappingArea" class="d-none mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="poMapping">Purchase order mapping (JSON)</label><textarea id="poMapping" class="form-control font-monospace" rows="4" spellcheck="false">{}</textarea></div></details><div id="settingsError" class="text-danger small mt-3" role="alert"></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><a class="me-auto small" href="https://app.docxtract.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Get your API key <i class="bi bi-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a><button type="button" class="btn btn-light" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button><button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Save profile</button></div></form></div></div></div>
<div class="modal fade" id="guideModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="guideTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><span class="eyebrow">WELCOME TO YOUR DESK</span><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close guide"></button></div><div class="modal-body guide-body"><div class="guide-symbol"><i class="bi bi-intersect" aria-hidden="true"></i></div><h2 id="guideTitle">From documents to a clear next step.</h2><p id="guideIntro" class="text-secondary"></p><ol id="guideSteps" class="guide-steps"></ol><div class="guide-tip"><i class="bi bi-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>No key yet? Try the sample workspace to explore the full review flow. For live extraction, get a key from <a href="https://app.docxtract.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DocXtract Settings</a>. Extraction uses account credits; testing the connection does not.</span></div><div class="form-check mt-4"><input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="hideGuide"><label class="form-check-label small" for="hideGuide">Skip this guide on future launches</label></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-light" id="guideSample">Explore sample data</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="guideStart">Set up my profile <i class="bi bi-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></div></div></div></div>
<div class="modal fade" id="reviewModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="reviewTitle" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-scrollable"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">EXTRACTION REVIEW</div><h2 id="reviewTitle" class="modal-title fs-4"></h2></div><button class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close review"></button></div><div class="modal-body"><div id="reviewSummary"></div><h3 class="fs-6 mt-4">Extracted data</h3><p class="small text-secondary">Review against your original document. Corrections are applied locally and do not call the API. The original extraction remains in the JSON export.</p><label class="visually-hidden" for="rawEditor">Editable extraction JSON</label><textarea id="rawEditor" class="form-control font-monospace" rows="13" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label" for="reviewNote">Correction note (required when changing data)</label><input class="form-control" id="reviewNote" placeholder="Describe the correction and source checked" maxlength="300"></div><div id="reviewError" class="small text-danger mt-2" role="alert"></div></div><div class="modal-footer"><button class="btn btn-light" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="saveReview">Apply corrections</button></div></div></div></div>
